  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> Power Rebuild Attachments</p>\n<p><em>Retooling rounds retroactively for rupturing within recesses results in rather remarkable armor removal.</em></p>\n<p>The Power Rebuild no longer increases Critical Injury Bonus Damage by 5. In exchange, whenever an attack from the weapon would ablate armor and incurs a randomly-rolled Critical Injury (i.e., not from a Leg Aimed Shot), it ablates 1 additional SP. This stacks with any special feature or ammunition that increases the amount of ablated SP.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Attachment Mods).</em></p>"
